# DRY policy

**Goal:** One authoritative definition per concept. Copy-paste is a bug unless extracted intentionally.

## Single source of truth

| Concern | Authority | Do not duplicate |
|---------|-----------|------------------|
| GROQ | `sanity/lib/queries.ts` | Inline queries in pages/components |
| Data access | `sanity/lib/fetchers.ts` (`get*`) | Direct `safeFetch` in routes |
| CMS types | `lib/types/` | Ad-hoc inline object shapes |
| SEO metadata | `pageMetadata()` in `lib/seo.ts` | Hand-built `<meta>` tags |
| Canonical paths | `lib/paths.ts` | String-concat paths in components |
| Tailwind patterns | `lib/tailwind.ts` (`TW_*`) | Same class string in 2+ files; raw `max-w-* mx-auto`, `py-16 sm:py-20`, eyebrow line |
| Theme tokens | `tailwind.config.ts` | Raw hex/spacing; Latin line-heights without Nastaliq tokens |
| Nastaliq leading / tracking | `tailwind.config.ts` + `03-rtl-urdu.mdc` | Ad-hoc `leading-tight` / negative tracking on Urdu |
| Rich text styles | `TW_RICH_TEXT_*` + `.rich-text` in `globals.css` | `prose-*` or per-page typography |
| Site URL / defaults | `lib/seo.ts`, `getSiteSettings()` | Hardcoded domain or phone/email |
| Runtime port | `deploy/runtime.cjs` | Magic `3001` outside deploy docs |
| Contact validation | `lib/contact-schema.ts` | Inline checks in API route |
| Rate limiting | `lib/rate-limit.ts` | Ad-hoc counters in routes |
| Cache tags | `lib/cache-tags.ts` | Untagged fetches |
| Nav tree helpers | `lib/navigation.ts` | Logic in `lib/types/` |
| Published dates (UI) | `formatPublishedDate()` in `lib/format-date.ts` | Ad-hoc `toLocaleDateString` |
| Section headers | `SectionHeaderRow` / `CenteredSectionHeader` | Copy-paste eyebrow+title blocks |
| Leaf dark heroes | `LeafHero` | Per-route hero markup |
| Portable Text wrapper | `RichTextBody.tsx` | Inline `PortableText` + duplicate `TW_RICH_TEXT_*` |
| Org name fallback | `DEFAULT_SITE_NAME` in `lib/seo.ts` | Hardcoded English org name in schemas |
| Urdu allowlist | `CLAUDE.md` § Urdu | Parallel English-copy rules elsewhere |

## When to extract

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Same class string **2+** times | Add `TW_*` to `lib/tailwind.ts` |
| Same GROQ field set **2+** queries | Private `SCREAMING_SNAKE` fragment in `queries.ts` |
| Same image URL builder **2+** callers | Helper in `sanity/lib/image.ts` |
| Same JSX block **2+** routes | Shared component in `components/content/` or `ui/` |
| Same fallback chain **2+** callers | `resolve*` / `format*` helper in `lib/` |
| Same breadcrumb/path logic | Use `lib/paths.ts` helpers |

## When duplication is OK

- Route-specific composition in thin `page.tsx` files
- One-off marketing copy in a single page
- Schema components that differ only by JSON-LD `@type`
- `// urdu-ok` suppressed strings

## Abstraction limits

- No generic `<Wrapper>` unless 3+ real use cases
- No premature `lib/utils.ts` — name by domain
- No shared props with 8+ optional flags — split components
- Do not merge unrelated fetchers

## Refactor order

1. Identify authority from table above  
2. Move definition; replace call sites  
3. Delete dead code  
4. `npm run lint && npm run check:urdu && npm run test` (+ `build` if wide)

